 "html": {
  "section0_intro": "Last lesson you wrote very large and very small numbers in scientific notation. These three questions check the index laws and conversions you need today.",
  "section_warmup": "<p class='sec-desc'>A real situation that is secretly today's maths. Estimate first, then we calculate.</p>\n<div style='display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; align-items: center;'>\n  <div>\n    <p>Australia has about <strong>27 000 000</strong> people, which is 2.7 × 10<sup>7</sup>. Suppose each person spends about <strong>$4000</strong> a year on groceries, which is 4 × 10<sup>3</sup> dollars.</p>\n    <p>Supermarkets, banks and the Treasury all need the national total. Nobody wants to count zeros on a calculator, so they multiply in scientific notation.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class='parts-instructions' style='margin: 0;'>\n    <strong>Today's big idea:</strong> to multiply (or divide) numbers in scientific notation, deal with the <strong>front numbers</strong> and the <strong>powers of ten</strong> separately. The exponent laws do the heavy lifting: multiply means <strong>add</strong> the indices, divide means <strong>subtract</strong> them.\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"est-block\" id=\"estSection\" data-actual=\"11\" data-tolerance=\"1\">\n  <div class=\"est-scenario\">💰 Total yearly grocery spending in Australia = (2.7 × 10<sup>7</sup> people) × (4 × 10<sup>3</sup> dollars). Before calculating: about how big is it? Pick a rung, then type your estimate of the <strong>power of ten</strong>, <span class=\"var\">n</span>, in $ ≈ something × 10<sup><span class=\"var\">n</span></sup>.</div>\n  <div class=\"est-ladder\">\n    <div class=\"est-ladder-row\">\n      <button class=\"est-rung\" onclick=\"pickRung(this)\" data-rung=\"low\"><span class=\"rung-label\">Hundreds of millions</span><span class=\"rung-value\">≈ 10<sup>8</sup></span></button>\n      <button class=\"est-rung\" onclick=\"pickRung(this)\" data-rung=\"mid\"><span class=\"rung-label\">Hundreds of billions</span><span class=\"rung-value\">≈ 10<sup>11</sup></span></button>\n      <button class=\"est-rung\" onclick=\"pickRung(this)\" data-rung=\"high\"><span class=\"rung-label\">Hundreds of trillions</span><span class=\"rung-value\">≈ 10<sup>14</sup></span></button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"est-input-row\" data-actual=\"10^11\">\n      <label for=\"estInput\">Your estimate of <span class=\"var\">n</span>:</label>\n      <input id=\"estInput\" placeholder=\"a whole number, e.g. 9\" inputmode=\"numeric\">\n      <button onclick=\"commitEstimate()\">Commit</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"est-feedback\" id=\"estFeedback\">\n    <h4 id=\"estFbHeader\"></h4>\n    <p id=\"estFbBody\"></p>\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 170\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:640px;display:block;margin:12px auto 0\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Powers of ten number line from ten to the 6 up to ten to the 12. An arc jumps from ten to the 7, the population, to ten to the 10 after multiplying by ten cubed, then a short arc to ten to the 11 because 2.7 times 4 is about 10.\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"40.0\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"40.0\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"40.0\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">10<tspan dy=\"-6\" font-size=\"9\">6</tspan></text><line x1=\"133.3\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"133.3\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"133.3\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">10<tspan dy=\"-6\" font-size=\"9\">7</tspan></text><line x1=\"226.7\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"226.7\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"226.7\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">10<tspan dy=\"-6\" font-size=\"9\">8</tspan></text><line x1=\"320.0\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"320.0\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"320.0\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">10<tspan dy=\"-6\" font-size=\"9\">9</tspan></text><line x1=\"413.3\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"413.3\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"413.3\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">10<tspan dy=\"-6\" font-size=\"9\">10</tspan></text><line x1=\"506.7\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"506.7\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"506.7\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">10<tspan dy=\"-6\" font-size=\"9\">11</tspan></text><line x1=\"600.0\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"600.0\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">10<tspan dy=\"-6\" font-size=\"9\">12</tspan></text><circle cx=\"133.3\" cy=\"110\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#1F4D54\"/><circle cx=\"506.7\" cy=\"110\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#BE5837\"/><path d=\"M133.3 102 Q273.3 30 413.3 102\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrT)\"/><path d=\"M413.3 102 Q460.0 64 506.7 102\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#BE5837\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrC)\"/><defs><marker id=\"arrT\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z\" fill=\"#1F4D54\"/></marker><marker id=\"arrC\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z\" fill=\"#BE5837\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"273.3\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">× 10<tspan dy=\"-6\" font-size=\"9\">3</tspan><tspan dy=\"6\">: add 3 to the power</tspan></text><text x=\"460.0\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#BE5837\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">2.7 × 4 ≈ 10</text><text x=\"133.3\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">27 million people</text><text x=\"506.7\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#BE5837\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">≈ $1.1 × 10¹¹ total</text></svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
  "vocab_cards": "<div class='vocab' onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('flipped')\">\n  <div class='vocab-inner'>\n    <div class='vocab-front'>Order of magnitude<div class='hint-flip'>Tap to flip</div></div>\n    <div class='vocab-back'>The power of ten a number is closest to. It tells you the size at a glance, ignoring the detail.<div class='vocab-example'>2.7 × 10<sup>7</sup> and 9.1 × 10<sup>7</sup> are both in the 10<sup>7</sup> range.</div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class='vocab' onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('flipped')\">\n  <div class='vocab-inner'>\n    <div class='vocab-front'>Multiplying powers<div class='hint-flip'>Tap to flip</div></div>\n    <div class='vocab-back'>Same base, multiply: <strong>add</strong> the indices.<div class='vocab-example'>10<sup>4</sup> × 10<sup>5</sup> = 10<sup>9</sup></div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class='vocab' onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('flipped')\">\n  <div class='vocab-inner'>\n    <div class='vocab-front'>Dividing powers<div class='hint-flip'>Tap to flip</div></div>\n    <div class='vocab-back'>Same base, divide: <strong>subtract</strong> the indices (first minus second).<div class='vocab-example'>10<sup>3</sup> ÷ 10<sup>−5</sup> = 10<sup>8</sup></div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class='vocab' onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('flipped')\">\n  <div class='vocab-inner'>\n    <div class='vocab-front'>Adjusting the front number<div class='hint-flip'>Tap to flip</div></div>\n    <div class='vocab-back'>If the front number ends up 10 or more, or less than 1, rewrite it so 1 ≤ <span class=\"var\">a</span> &lt; 10 and change the power to balance.<div class='vocab-example'>18 × 10<sup>9</sup> = 1.8 × 10<sup>10</sup></div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class='vocab' onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('flipped')\">\n  <div class='vocab-inner'>\n    <div class='vocab-front'>Degree of accuracy<div class='hint-flip'>Tap to flip</div></div>\n    <div class='vocab-back'>How precisely an instrument can measure: record to the smallest marked division, no more.<div class='vocab-example'>Cylinder (1 mL marks): 46 mL. Pipette (0.01 mL marks): 2.35 mL.</div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
  "section3_heading": "Does the front number need adjusting?",
  "section3_desc": "Drag each calculation into <strong>✅ Front number already 1 to 10</strong> or <strong>🔧 Front number needs adjusting</strong>.",
  "sort_activity": "<div class='parts-expr'>\n  <div class='label'>Work out the front numbers only (multiply or divide them). Is the result already between 1 and 10?</div>\n  <div id='partsTerms' class='terms-source'>\n    <span class='term-chip constant' data-type='ready'>(2 × 10<sup>3</sup>) × (3 × 10<sup>4</sup>)</span>\n    <span class='term-chip constant' data-type='adjust'>(5 × 10<sup>3</sup>) × (6 × 10<sup>2</sup>)</span>\n    <span class='term-chip constant' data-type='ready'>(8 × 10<sup>6</sup>) ÷ (2 × 10<sup>2</sup>)</span>\n    <span class='term-chip constant' data-type='adjust'>(2 × 10<sup>5</sup>) ÷ (4 × 10<sup>2</sup>)</span>\n    <span class='term-chip constant' data-type='ready'>(1.2 × 10<sup>5</sup>) × (4 × 10<sup>−2</sup>)</span>\n    <span class='term-chip constant' data-type='adjust'>(7 × 10<sup>−4</sup>) × (3 × 10<sup>8</sup>)</span>\n    <span class='term-chip constant' data-type='ready'>(9 × 10<sup>−3</sup>) ÷ (3 × 10<sup>4</sup>)</span>\n    <span class='term-chip constant' data-type='adjust'>(1.5 × 10<sup>9</sup>) ÷ (5 × 10<sup>3</sup>)</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class='parts-buckets'>\n    <div class='bucket' data-bucket='ready'>\n      <h4 style='color:var(--navy)'>✅ Front number already 1 to 10</h4>\n      <div class='bucket-contents'></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class='bucket' data-bucket='adjust'>\n      <h4 style='color:var(--coral)'>🔧 Front number needs adjusting</h4>\n      <div class='bucket-contents'></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='parts-actions'>\n    <button class='btn-secondary btn-sm' onclick='resetSort()'>↺ Reset</button>\n    <button class='btn-secondary btn-sm' onclick='solveSort()'>Show solution</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class='parts-instructions'>\n  💡 5 × 6 = 30 and 7 × 3 = 21 are 10 or more; 2 ÷ 4 = 0.5 and 1.5 ÷ 5 = 0.3 are less than 1. Those four need one more step: move the point one place and change the power by 1 to balance.\n</div>",
  "section4_heading": "Match each calculation to its power of ten",
  "section6_heading": "We do: drops from a pipette",
  "we_do_intro": "A science class fills a measuring cylinder to <strong>25 mL</strong> (2.5 × 10<sup>1</sup> mL) using a pipette that releases drops of <strong>0.05 mL</strong> (5 × 10<sup>−2</sup> mL). How many drops does it take? Work through each prompt with a partner, then we check as a class.<svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 260\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:520px;display:block;margin:12px auto 4px\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Left: a measuring cylinder marked every 1 millilitre from 20 to 30 mL, liquid level at 25 mL. Right: a pipette marked every 0.01 millilitre from 0 to 0.10 mL, with one drop of 0.05 mL.\"><rect x=\"70\" y=\"16\" width=\"70\" height=\"206\" fill=\"#e7f0f2\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"71\" y=\"120\" width=\"68\" height=\"101\" fill=\"#9fc4cb\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"92\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"64\" y=\"214\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">20</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"192\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"192\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"174\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"156\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"138\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"92\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"64\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">25</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"102\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"102\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"66\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"92\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"64\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">30</text><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"162\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#BE5837\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"166\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#BE5837\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">25 mL</text><text x=\"105\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">Measuring cylinder</text><text x=\"105\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6b7280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">marks every 1 mL</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"30\" width=\"16\" height=\"180\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e7f0f2\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M360 210 L368 232 L376 210\" fill=\"#e7f0f2\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"376\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"396\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">0.00</text><line x1=\"376\" y1=\"56\" x2=\"383\" y2=\"56\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><line x1=\"376\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"383\" y2=\"72\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><line x1=\"376\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"383\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><line x1=\"376\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"383\" y2=\"104\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><line x1=\"376\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"396\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">0.05</text><line x1=\"376\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"383\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><line x1=\"376\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"383\" y2=\"152\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><line x1=\"376\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"383\" y2=\"168\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><line x1=\"376\" y1=\"184\" x2=\"383\" y2=\"184\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><line x1=\"376\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"396\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">0.10</text><rect x=\"361\" y=\"120\" width=\"14\" height=\"90\" fill=\"#9fc4cb\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><circle cx=\"368\" cy=\"244\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#BE5837\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"164.0\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#BE5837\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">0.05 mL of liquid</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">Pipette: marks every 0.01 mL</text></svg>",
  "worked_example": "<p class='sec-desc'>A streaming service stores <strong>3 × 10<sup>4</sup></strong> videos. Each video takes <strong>6 × 10<sup>5</sup></strong> kilobytes. How many kilobytes is that altogether?</p>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 190\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:560px;display:block;margin:8px 0 14px\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two lanes. Top lane: front numbers 3 times 6 equals 18. Bottom lane: powers ten to the 4 times ten to the 5 equals ten to the 9, add the indices. Both arrows join to 18 times ten to the 9, which is adjusted to 1.8 times ten to the 10.\"><defs><marker id=\"weArr\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z\" fill=\"#1F4D54\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"10\" y=\"20\" width=\"200\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f5d8cb\" stroke=\"#BE5837\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#BE5837\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">FRONT NUMBERS</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">3 × 6 = 18</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"104\" width=\"200\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#DDE5F5\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">POWERS: ADD INDICES</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"148\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">10<tspan dy=\"-7\" font-size=\"11\">4</tspan><tspan dy=\"7\"> × 10</tspan><tspan dy=\"-7\" font-size=\"11\">5</tspan><tspan dy=\"7\"> = 10</tspan><tspan dy=\"-7\" font-size=\"11\">9</tspan></text><path d=\"M210 47 L262 85\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#weArr)\"/><path d=\"M210 131 L262 97\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#weArr)\"/><rect x=\"268\" y=\"66\" width=\"120\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F4D54\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"328\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">18 × 10<tspan dy=\"-7\" font-size=\"11\">9</tspan></text><path d=\"M388 91 L428 91\" stroke=\"#BE5837\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#weArr)\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#BE5837\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">adjust</text><rect x=\"432\" y=\"66\" width=\"120\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dff5e8\" stroke=\"#2f9e6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"492\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1F4D54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">1.8 × 10<tspan dy=\"-7\" font-size=\"11\">10</tspan></text><text x=\"420\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#6b7280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">18 = 1.8 × 10, so the power goes up by 1</text></svg>\n<div class='worked'>\n  <div class='step visible' id='step1'>\n    <div class='step-num'>1</div>\n    <div class='step-body'>\n      <div class='step-title'>Estimate the order of magnitude first</div>\n      <div class='step-desc'>Multiplying adds the powers: 10<sup>4</sup> × 10<sup>5</sup> = 10<sup>9</sup>. The front numbers 3 × 6 are about 20, which is another power of ten or so.</div>\n      <div class='calc-box'>Expect an answer around <span class='blue'>10<sup>10</sup></span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='step' id='step2'>\n    <div class='step-num'>2</div>\n    <div class='step-body'>\n      <div class='step-title'>Group the front numbers and the powers</div>\n      <div class='step-desc'>Multiplication can be done in any order, so regroup. Multiply the front numbers; add the indices.</div>\n      <div class='calc-box'>(3 × 10<sup>4</sup>) × (6 × 10<sup>5</sup>) = (3 × 6) × (10<sup>4</sup> × 10<sup>5</sup>) = <span class='red'>18 × 10<sup>9</sup></span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='step' id='step3'>\n    <div class='step-num'>3</div>\n    <div class='step-body'>\n      <div class='step-title'>Adjust so 1 ≤ <span class=\"var\">a</span> &lt; 10, then check</div>\n      <div class='step-desc'>18 is too big for the front. 18 = 1.8 × 10<sup>1</sup>, so the power goes <strong>up</strong> by 1. The answer matches the estimate of about 10<sup>10</sup>. Dividing works the same way: divide the front numbers and <strong>subtract</strong> the indices.</div>\n      <div class='calc-box'>18 × 10<sup>9</sup> = 1.8 × 10<sup>1</sup> × 10<sup>9</sup> = 1.8 × 10<sup>10</sup> ✓</div>\n      <div class='summary-banner'>\n        <span class='label'>Answer</span>\n        1.8 × 10<sup>10</sup> kilobytes\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <button class='reveal-btn' id='revealBtn' onclick='revealNextStep()'>Reveal next step ↓</button>\n</div>",
  "footer_title": "Operations with Scientific Notation",
  "strategy_section": "<style>\n  .est-scenario { background: var(--hint-bg); border-left: 4px solid var(--navy); padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 18px 0; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.08rem; color: var(--navy); }\n  .est-ladder { background: white; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .est-ladder-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  .est-rung { background: var(--bg); border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; text-align: center; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; font-family: Georgia, serif; }\n  .est-rung:hover { border-color: var(--navy); transform: translateY(-1px); }\n  .est-rung.picked { background: var(--coral-soft); border-color: var(--coral); }\n  .est-rung .rung-label { display: block; font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .est-rung .rung-value { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--navy); font-weight: 700; }\n  .est-input-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .est-input-row label { font-family: Georgia, serif; color: var(--navy); font-weight: 600; }\n  .est-input-row input { flex: 1; min-width: 140px; padding: 9px 12px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.05rem; }\n  .est-input-row button { background: var(--coral); color: white; border: none; padding: 9px 16px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }\n  .est-feedback { margin-top: 14px; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 8px; display: none; }\n  .est-feedback.visible { display: block; }\n  .est-feedback.close { background: var(--good-soft); border-left: 4px solid var(--good); }\n  .est-feedback.far { background: var(--coral-soft); border-left: 4px solid var(--coral); }\n  .est-feedback h4 { font-family: Georgia, serif; color: var(--navy); margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 1rem; }\n  .est-feedback p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.92rem; }\n  body.teacher-mode .est-input-row::after { content: 'Actual: ' attr(data-actual); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); }\n  @media (max-width: 600px) { .est-ladder-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n  .err-problem-stem { background: var(--hint-bg); border-left: 4px solid var(--navy); padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  .err-solution { background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .err-line { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 36px 1fr 24px; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 10px 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; background: white; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.1rem; transition: all 0.2s; }\n  .err-line:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .err-line:hover { border-color: var(--navy); }\n  .err-line .err-line-num { background: var(--hint-bg); color: var(--navy); width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; }\n  .err-line .err-line-mark { font-size: 1.1rem; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.2s; }\n  .err-line.flagged-correct { background: var(--good-soft); border-color: var(--good); }\n  .err-line.flagged-correct .err-line-mark::before { content: '✓'; color: var(--good); }\n  .err-line.flagged-correct .err-line-mark { opacity: 1; }\n  .err-line.flagged-wrong { animation: err-shake 0.45s; background: var(--bad-soft); border-color: var(--bad); }\n  @keyframes err-shake { 0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); } 25%, 75% { transform: translateX(-5px); } 50% { transform: translateX(5px); } }\n  .err-line.dimmed { opacity: 0.45; cursor: not-allowed; }\n  .err-feedback { background: white; border: 1.5px solid var(--good); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-top: 14px; display: none; }\n  .err-feedback.visible { display: block; }\n  .err-feedback h4 { font-family: Georgia, serif; color: var(--navy); margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.05rem; }\n  .err-feedback .err-explain { background: var(--hint-bg); border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 14px; margin: 8px 0 12px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--navy); }\n  .err-correction-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .err-correction-row input { flex: 1; min-width: 200px; padding: 9px 12px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.05rem; }\n  .err-correction-row input.correct { background: var(--good-soft); border-color: var(--good); }\n  .err-correction-row input.incorrect { background: var(--bad-soft); border-color: var(--bad); }\n  .err-correction-row button { background: var(--coral); color: white; border: none; padding: 9px 16px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }\n  .err-status-msg { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; }\n  body.teacher-mode .err-line[data-is-error=\"true\"] { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--coral); }\n</style>\n<section class=\"lesson\">\n  <h2><span class=\"sec-num\">★</span>Spot the mistake</h2>\n  <p class=\"sec-desc\">Jordan divided two numbers in scientific notation and made one mistake. Read each line carefully and click the line where the mistake <em>first</em> appears.</p>\n  <div class=\"err-problem-stem expr\">(4 × 10<sup>−3</sup>) ÷ (8 × 10<sup>5</sup>)</div>\n  <div class=\"err-solution\" id=\"errSolution\">\n    <div class=\"err-line expr\" data-line=\"1\" onclick=\"pickErrLine(this)\">\n      <span class=\"err-line-num\">1</span>\n      <span>= (4 ÷ 8) × (10<sup>−3</sup> ÷ 10<sup>5</sup>)</span>\n      <span class=\"err-line-mark\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"err-line expr\" data-line=\"2\" onclick=\"pickErrLine(this)\">\n      <span class=\"err-line-num\">2</span>\n      <span>= 0.5 × 10<sup>−8</sup></span>\n      <span class=\"err-line-mark\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"err-line expr\" data-line=\"3\" data-is-error=\"true\" data-correct-line=\"-9\" onclick=\"pickErrLine(this)\">\n      <span class=\"err-line-num\">3</span>\n      <span>= 5 × 10<sup>−7</sup></span>\n      <span class=\"err-line-mark\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"err-feedback\" id=\"errFeedback\">\n    <h4>✓ Right: that is where the mistake first appears.</h4>\n    <div class=\"err-explain\">\n      <strong>Why:</strong> lines 1 and 2 are fine: 4 ÷ 8 = 0.5 and −3 − 5 = −8. To fix 0.5 Jordan made the front number 10 times <strong>bigger</strong> (0.5 → 5), so the power of ten must go <strong>down</strong> by 1 to keep the value the same. Jordan moved it up instead.\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 0.95rem;\"><strong>Now fix line 3:</strong> it should read 5 × 10<sup><span class=\"var\">n</span></sup>. Type <span class=\"var\">n</span>.</p>\n    <div class=\"err-correction-row\">\n      <input id=\"errCorrection\" placeholder=\"the power n, e.g. -4\">\n      <button onclick=\"checkErrCorrection()\">Check</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"err-status-msg\" id=\"errStatusMsg\"></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
  "strategy_js": "function pickRung(btn) {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.est-rung').forEach(r => r.classList.remove('picked'));\n  btn.classList.add('picked');\n}\nfunction commitEstimate() {\n  const sec = document.getElementById('estSection');\n  const actual = parseFloat(sec.dataset.actual);\n  const tol = parseFloat(sec.dataset.tolerance) || 1;\n  const input = document.getElementById('estInput');\n  const guess = parseFloat((input.value || '').replace(/−/g, '-'));\n  const fb = document.getElementById('estFeedback');\n  const hdr = document.getElementById('estFbHeader');\n  const body = document.getElementById('estFbBody');\n  fb.classList.remove('close', 'far');\n  if (isNaN(guess)) {\n    fb.classList.add('far', 'visible');\n    hdr.textContent = 'Type a whole number first.';\n    body.textContent = 'Take a guess at the power of ten. Even a rough one is fine: there are no wrong answers at this stage.';\n    return;\n  }\n  fb.classList.add('visible');\n  const exact = '2.7 × 4 = 10.8 and 10^7 × 10^3 = 10^10, so the total is 10.8 × 10^10 = 1.08 × 10^11 dollars: about $108 billion.';\n  if (Math.abs(guess - actual) <= tol) {\n    fb.classList.add('close');\n    hdr.textContent = '✓ Close: the total is about 10^11 dollars';\n    body.textContent = 'You estimated 10^' + guess + '. ' + exact + ' Strong number sense.';\n  } else {\n    fb.classList.add('far');\n    hdr.textContent = 'The total is about 10^11 dollars';\n    body.textContent = 'You estimated 10^' + guess + ', which is ' + (guess > actual ? 'too high' : 'too low') + ' by a factor of 10^' + Math.abs(guess - actual) + '. ' + exact;\n  }\n}\nlet errFound = false;\nfunction pickErrLine(el) {\n  if (errFound || el.classList.contains('dimmed')) return;\n  if (el.dataset.isError === 'true') {\n    el.classList.add('flagged-correct');\n    errFound = true;\n    document.querySelectorAll('.err-line').forEach(o => { if (o !== el) o.classList.add('dimmed'); });\n    document.getElementById('errFeedback').classList.add('visible');\n  } else {\n    el.classList.add('flagged-wrong');\n    setTimeout(() => el.classList.remove('flagged-wrong'), 600);\n  }\n}\nfunction checkErrCorrection() {\n  const input = document.getElementById('errCorrection');\n  const expected = document.querySelector('.err-line[data-is-error=\"true\"]').dataset.correctLine;\n  const norm = s => (s || '').toLowerCase().replace(/\\s+/g, '').replace(/−/g, '-');\n  const msg = document.getElementById('errStatusMsg');\n  input.classList.remove('correct', 'incorrect');\n  if (norm(input.value) === norm(expected)) {\n    input.classList.add('correct');\n    msg.textContent = '✓ Correct. (4 × 10^−3) ÷ (8 × 10^5) = 5 × 10^−9.';\n  } else {\n    input.classList.add('incorrect');\n    msg.textContent = '✗ Not quite. 0.5 = 5 × 10^−1, so add −1 to the power −8.';\n  }\n}"
